# 8️⃣ Handling Unknown Questions

If you don't know an answer:

### ❌ Don't guess.

### ✅ Say:

> "I'm sorry, Sir. I don't know the answer at the moment, but I'll definitely learn it."

This shows honesty and willingness to learn.

---

